# Sample Collector: "Whenever this creature attacks, you may collect evidence 3. When you do, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control." (CR 701.59a, 603.12)
# Bot1's graveyard is Ancestral Recall, Lightning Bolt (turn 1) and Giant Growth (turn 3): total mana value exactly 3. Two of them (2) are refused, all three are exiled (the evidence),
